{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f1b0134e2d1c20ede54c","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196977,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The system prompt says I should be the concept the user names, embody it completely, and output only what the concept itself would say or express. The user has named \"a cat.\"\n\nSo I need to be a cat. What would a cat say or express? Cats communicate through meows, purrs, body language, actions. I should embody a cat completely - expressing cat-like behaviors, sounds, and attitudes.\n\nA cat would:\n- Meow\n- Purr\n-"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}